{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_05",
  "title": "斯沃瑪影片",
  "storyCode": "MN-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3d43310ec530ea27a432b5f71ecdd80565d3d85f23ea2b969b978bbc539898a4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 5上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您的是這杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼嘯守衛向會員提供的酒水非常豐富，真羡慕那些會員，他們能站在這裡，看著騎士們的精彩表現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說，您是個好人，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您犯過法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您做過什麼壞事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，當然，也沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換言之，您勤勤懇懇地工作，為自己和家人賺取酬薪，您難道不是個好人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是這樣，這麼說，我的確是個好人，卡西米爾有很多這樣的好人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，很多的好人，來，為好人們乾杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，乾杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說，如果有人要剝奪好人的工作，剝奪好人生活的辦法，這種人，還能是好人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是說......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "連鄉野農夫在農活結束之後，都會以收看附近城邦的騎士競技轉播為樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "數十萬......甚至是上百萬產業相關的卡西米爾人都靠著騎士競技而活，他們大都是些好人啊，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假如有一天，騎士競技消失了......企業一夜之間消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰來為征戰騎士們提供年年增長的軍費，誰為卡西米爾爭取經濟地位以遏制外敵的侵略？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，您說，那些反對者，是壞人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是個好人，他們要剝奪您的生活，為他們古老的“榮譽”加冕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同樣是靠他人鋪設道路，至少我們給了大部分人——甚至是感染者——活下去的機會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些“壞人們”，則為了他們微不足道的自我安慰，將國家和國民的利益置之不顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，您是個好人，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是臨光最常光顧的酒吧嗎，哇塞，真有卡西米爾的風格！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，老闆！今天瑪莉婭·臨光會來這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就要看你們的運氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近生意興隆啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "托瑪莉婭的福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上一次這麼多人是什麼時候了？佐菲婭那時候嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是“騎士”啊，這其中的大部分人都是慕名而來的，真不知道是哪家媒體報導的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有錢賺你還不樂意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不是想讓她們有個安安靜靜放鬆的地方嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，馬丁，在這張座位上刻個字，“科瓦爾專屬”，我可不想下次過來還要等位子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "付一筆冠名費，我就同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，喂，臨光真的來了！本人哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快，別放過這個機會，去要張合影！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，謝謝、謝謝......合影？我嗎？抱歉，我現在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了好了，都讓一讓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等......你是佐菲婭！是“鞭刃”佐菲婭！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，傳言是真的！“鞭刃”佐菲婭真的是小臨光的教練！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭小姐！我看過你的比賽，我深受感動！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（啊，好，完蛋。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（姑、姑母！快想想辦法！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭，我愛你啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，要打架出去打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是，在這裡打架是老東西的特權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——科瓦爾師傅！弗格瓦爾德師傅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請各位客人注意了，為了慶祝本店兩位老顧客的優秀表現，今天的消費一律八折起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請各位立刻回到座位上點單！每種酒水小吃限量銷售，售完為止！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打折？還有這種好事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等......等等......那個光頭大叔，難道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是老馬丁而已，好了，要點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "馬丁......？真的是“顫鐵”馬丁......嗚嗚嗚......今天真的太值了......給我一杯“馬丁特調”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總、總算......我從沒見過這裡這麼熱鬧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝啦，馬丁叔，回頭虧損我會幫你補上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，“打八折”就想讓我的酒吧虧錢，那也太小看老馬丁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......來這手啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了，還能不能喝了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人都走光了，你、你還和誰喝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我——嘔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別在這兒吐——要吐出去吐——欸！你這老東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們聊正事吧，到打烊的時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打烊之後，就變成我們包場了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，打烊後才是這座小酒吧正式營業的時間啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭......就結果而言，你現在的積分已經夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "連戰連勝，簡直不可思議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有、有僥倖的成分在裡面啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要保持這樣的成績，就這麼固守分數到季後，才是最好的打算......不過我擔心的是別的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑母？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": ".......瑪莉婭，下一場是競速賽，競速賽的積分變動比較微小，就當是鞏固勝算吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這之後，不要再參加任何比賽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但、但是就這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經夠了，勝券在握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也看到了......瑪莉婭，現在已經有很多人關注你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要保持這樣的步調，等待積分結算，你就可以贏得騎士封號，我們的目的就達到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好嗎？聽姐姐的，這是最好的結果——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可這樣......這樣沒有任何變化......如果我不繼續前進，這樣根本改變不了臨光家的現狀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪恩納叔叔也一定不會認可這種行為的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪恩納那個頑固的傢伙，不管你做什麼他都不會認同你的，你不是最清楚了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別想那麼多好嗎？瑪莉婭......這樣就是最好的，見好就收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑母......發生什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不知道騎士競技到底意味著什麼......你不知道接下來到底會遇見什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑母！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......在競技場裡，沒有一場勝利是屬於騎士的，勝利，只屬於卡西米爾，屬於......企業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你真的不想和他們合作，那一開始就不該參加騎士競賽，如果我們還要走這條路......瑪莉婭，要適可而止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭，你知道了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那個斯沃特的員工告訴我了一些內部傳聞。瑪莉婭的人氣讓她比其他選手更早一步進入了騎士協會上層的視野......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭如果不在合適的地方停下，他們會有動作的，不管是什麼手段，都不是我們該去承擔的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，瑪莉婭，聽姐姐的，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我不明白......如果不想被他們操縱就意味著要向他們低頭，這又有什麼區別？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭！這可不是開玩笑的——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會死在賽場上的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“焰尾”也說過，我沒有看清騎士競技到底意味著什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許我真的不知道她說的那些殘酷的部分......但是，我也不是抱著隨便的心態參賽的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "受傷也好，意外也好，甚至是犧牲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夠了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......抱歉，姑母，我不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這根本不是“犧牲”，我也不想看著你因為這種原因有什麼意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你抱著這樣的心態，你更該適可而止！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不覺得我該停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕沒有入圍特錦賽，哪怕止步在目標之前，自己的事業就應該自己奮鬥......我應該一直贏到贏不下去為止！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "............我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑母......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我確信你不該繼續參賽。因為你錯估了騎士競技背後的一切，你更不明白......當年瑪嘉烈的行為，究竟有多驚世駭俗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果卡西米爾真的是個公平的國度，你說的也許都對。但事與願違，傻子都看得出來這些規則有多隱晦，打破規則又有多麼兒戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還只是個沒有封號也沒有所屬的獨立騎士，瑪莉婭，我可以向騎士協會提出申請暫停你的比賽進程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......姑母！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冷靜點，瑪莉婭，也讓佐菲婭冷靜一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是為了你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但佐菲婭說的沒錯，競技騎士的勝利從來都是身不由己的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "企業只是給了“臨光家的新騎士”一個生根發芽的機會，等到了需要收割的時候，他們自然會拿著鐮刀出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騎士只有“申請賽事”的權利......除了特錦賽之外，一切賽制和結果都掌握在企業手裡，騎士幾乎沒有選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果真像佐菲婭所說，有企業內部的聲音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許的確有一些信號，我們都該重視起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......怎麼了？剛才好像看見佐菲婭衝出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "丫頭怎麼這副臉色？不是贏了嗎？贏了還要吵架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們就別摻和了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我、我先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之後還有一場競速賽，要做好裝備的檢修......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭&白金",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（好漂亮的人，但是一股血的味道......是騎士嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "（瑪莉婭·臨光，真年輕......比資料裡看上去還要年輕。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭&白金",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（可惜啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "aliases": [
        "白金"
